<section class="apk-faq centerx" aria-labelledby="apk-faq-title">
    <div class="apk-faq__box">
        <div class="apk-faq__head">
            <h2 id="apk-faq-title">
                Micro RPG FAQ
            </h2>
            <p>Common questions users often ask.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="apk-faq__list">
                                            <details class="apk-faq__item" open>
                    <summary class="apk-faq__question">
                        How to play Micro RPG?                    </summary>
                    <div class="apk-faq__answer">
                        <p>Micro RPG is an offline role-playing game. You control a hero through dungeons, fight monsters, and level up. Just tap to move and attack.</p>
                    </div>
                </details>
                                            <details class="apk-faq__item" >
                    <summary class="apk-faq__question">
                        What is Micro RPG?                    </summary>
                    <div class="apk-faq__answer">
                        <p>Micro RPG is a compact role-playing game for Android. It focuses on quick dungeon runs and character progression without complex controls.</p>
                    </div>
                </details>
                                            <details class="apk-faq__item" >
                    <summary class="apk-faq__question">
                        Is Micro RPG offline?                    </summary>
                    <div class="apk-faq__answer">
                        <p>Yes, Micro RPG is fully playable offline. You don&#039;t need an internet connection to enjoy the game.</p>
                    </div>
                </details>
                    </div>
    </div>
</section>
